y Hyde"],"date":"2022-08-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11#:~:text=New%20Argive%20will%20mobilize.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 2: Sand in the Hourglass\" by Langley Hyde. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Aug 2022."}},{"id":"episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11-e15","era":null,"summary":"Jodah opens a portal to New Argive's watchtower; Karn, Teferi, Stenn and Jodah escape while Jaya burns the room.","participants":["jodah","jaya-ballard","karn","teferi","stenn"],"location":"new-argive-s-watchtower","importance":"major","page":"stories/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11","order":801,"story_date":"2022-08-11","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":239,"quote":"Jaya grinned in triumph as she raised her hands in a blaze of fire and set the whole room alight.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11#:~:text=Jaya%20grinned%20in%20triumph,the%20whole%20room%20alight.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 2: Sand in the Hourglass","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Langley Hyde"],"date":"2022-08-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11#:~:text=Jaya%20grinned%20in%20triumph,the%20whole%20room%20alight.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 2: Sand in the Hourglass\" by Langley Hyde. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Aug 2022."}},{"id":"episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11-e16","era":null,"summary":"A Phyrexian creature follows through the portal; Stenn locks down the watchtower and gives Karn the key, as they realize they cannot trust anyone.","participants":["stenn","karn","jodah","jaya-ballard","teferi","phyrexians"],"location":"